Subject: [PATCH] unicode: lazy collapse + ASCII consume + byte-span
 materialize (0109)

Skip text_collapsed when custom pretok matches; ASCII letter/digit consume
(T01); materialize valid UTF-8 pretoks via original byte spans. Identity-safe.
See docs/faster-bpe-tokenize.md (M15d / 0109).
